                "markdown": "User-controlled navigation path passed to Include(string). Dynamic Include allows traversal of relations and can expose sensitive data.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/203.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/203.html)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-Broken_Access_Control/](https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-Broken_Access_Control/)\n - [https://www.elttam.com/blog/leaking-more-than-you-joined-for/](https://www.elttam.com/blog/leaking-more-than-you-joined-for/)\n",
                "text": "User-controlled navigation path passed to Include(string). Dynamic Include allows traversal of relations and can expose sensitive data."
              },
